    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not that simple though. it's not just \"a bad time.\" it's like the version of me that people knew is just... dead. i go to the dining hall and i see my friends laughing and i realize i'm not part of that world anymore. it's not even that they hate me, it's just that i'm nothing to them now. how do you move forward when the person you were doesn't even exist in anyone's head anymore?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
