      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your pain of feeling invisible is profound and valid, but your worth isn't defined by how others currently perceive you. Moving forward often starts by allowing yourself to let go of the need to be who you used to be rather than forcing a connection that isn't ready. You are not nothing, even when the world forgets to look at you, because you deserve to be heard and supported today. Please remember that asking for help to rebuild your sense of self is a brave and necessary step.",
