      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It makes sense that forcing a new version feels impossible when you are buried so deep in grief, and there is no shame in resting until you feel ready again. The empty space you feel is simply the aftermath of what was lost, not a permanent state of your life. Please allow yourself to rest without pressure to heal immediately, and reach out to someone who can sit with you in this heaviness.",
